"L006"},{"actor":"rana","start":38.07,"text":{"en":"Tolerance. TOL-er-ance. Three syllables, and the first one is loud.","ar":"Tolerance. الحدّ المسموح. ثلاثة مقاطع، والأوّل هو القويّ."},"id":"L007"},{"actor":"rana","start":44.348,"text":{"en":"Measure. MEA-sure. Two syllables, and the first one is loud.","ar":"Measure. القياس. مقطعان، والأوّل هو القويّ."},"id":"L008"},{"actor":"rana","start":50.146,"text":{"en":"Diagnosis. di-ag-NO-sis. Four syllables, and the THIRD one is loud.","ar":"Diagnosis. التشخيص. أربعة مقاطع، والثالث هو القويّ."},"id":"L009"},{"actor":"rana","start":57.36,"text":{"en":"Five of the six words stress the first syllable. Diagnosis is the one that does not.","ar":"خمس من الكلمات الستّ تُشدّد على المقطع الأوّل. التشخيص هي الكلمة التي تخالف ذلك."},"id":"L010"},{"actor":"tarek","start":63.806,"text":{"en":"Which syllable is loud in diagnosis?","ar":"أيّ مقطع هو القويّ في كلمة diagnosis؟"},"subHold":8.382,"id":"L011"},{"actor":"tarek","start":72.188,"text":{"en":"The third one. di-ag-NO-sis.","ar":"الثالث. di-ag-NO-sis."},"id":"L012"},{"actor":"rana","start":76.45,"text":{"en":"One more thing about gauge. It is spelled with five letters but said as one syllable, and the G at the end is soft, like the J in job.","ar":"أمر آخر عن كلمة gauge. تُكتب بخمسة أحرف لكنّها تُنطق مقطعاً واحداً، وحرف G في آخرها لَيِّن، كحرف J في job."},"id":"L013"},{"actor":"tarek","start":85.464,"text":{"en":"So how many syllables does gauge have, and how many does tolerance have?","ar":"فكم مقطعاً في كلمة gauge، وكم مقطعاً في كلمة tolerance؟"},"subHold":12.299,"id":"L014"},{"actor":"tarek","start":97.763,"text":{"en":"Gauge has one. Tolerance has three. The longest word here is the one with the most syllables.","ar":"في gauge مقطع واحد. وفي tolerance ثلاثة. وأطول كلمة هنا هي التي فيها أكثر المقاطع."},"id":"L015"},{"actor":"rana","start":106.057,"text":{"en":"Say all six again, and tap the loud syllable with your hand as you say it.","ar":"قل الستّ كلّها مرّة أخرى، واطرق على المقطع القويّ بيدك وأنت تنطقه."},"id":"L016"}],"subtitles":{"enabled":true,"langs":"en,ar","show":null,"textMode":"wrapShrink","lang":{}},"badgePlacement":{"x":"0.016","y":"0.016","width":"0.205"},"audio":{"master":"audio.m4a","lines":[{"key":"39fd1425f533e22e","bytes":44640,"sha":"19d6a627534e2a7c","address":"lines/39fd1425f533e22e.mp3"},{"key":"42cba3e2c053278c","bytes":35280,"sha":"8d315dd997b52cf5","address":"lines/42cba3e2c053278c.mp3"},{"key":"06a32b202d8fc439","bytes":33840,"sha":"f211f1fa9f036ed5","address":"lines/06a32b202d8fc439.mp3"},{"key":"3c373577a80e1065","bytes":31968,"sha":"eb1822422aa6beb3","address":"lines/3c373577a80e1065.mp3"},{"key":"2ef9d34f4ba4034a","bytes":31680,"sha":"b35b4f444ae2b4ad","address":"lines/2ef9d34f4ba4034a.mp3"},{"key":"8d0a1e11e65ba003","bytes":35712,"sha":"fee6e2fbd611548c","address":"lines/8d0a1e11e65ba003.mp3"},{"key":"e635ed5bfb49ed19","bytes":35568,"sha":"fad53bdffc051ad6","address":"lines/e635ed5bfb49ed19.mp3"},{"key":"b243c039c55f6b90","bytes":32688,"sha":"00d6afc4cbd81b8d","address":"lines/b243c039c55f6b90.mp3"},{"key":"3734b8513d8d2abf","bytes":41184,"sha":"3cf26149bf67bc07","address":"lines/3734b8513d8d2abf.mp3"},{"key":"f7e62e80df14e757","bytes":36576,"sha":"2315dcb9dcc9d253","address":"lines/f7e62e80df14e757.mp3"},{"key":"01ca9a79d999f0fd","bytes":19584,"sha":"63a585ee69fa16ce","address":"lines/01ca9a79d999f0fd.mp3"},{"key":"33252268606c187d","bytes":23472,"sha":"331d6c5a4482d79c","address":"lines/33252268606c187d.mp3"},{"key":"48ea9de7b8aef4ec","bytes":51984,"sha":"416a737de34c5921","address":"lines/48ea9de7b8aef4ec.mp3"},{"key":"5177d62f65838a6a","bytes":30384,"sha":"5daffa2dbb773857","address":"lines/5177d62f65838a6a.mp3"},{"key":"353085fa29d07c2f","bytes":47664,"sha":"286bd138e3de802d","address":"lines/353085fa29d07c2f.mp3"},{"key":"2386371c0c13aba7","bytes":28800,"sha":"928cb5d90eda4409","address":"lines/2386371c0c13aba7.mp3"}],"music":{"enabled":false},"duck":[{"start":0.45,"dur":7.44},{"start":8.24,"dur":5.8